# One press of J is the plain flip: a second press after doubleTapTicks (16) does not turn a Kickflip
# into a Double Kickflip (it is ignored while the flip runs, as before the double tap).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
tap flip 116
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 120..160
expect no event trickStart{trick=Double Kickflip}
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip,points=100} within 160..240
expect no event bail
